<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email - SkillHarbor</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1e293b;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #0284c7 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .email-header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .verify-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #0284c7 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);
        }
        .verify-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.4);
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .info-box p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #475569;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .alternative-link {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .alternative-link a {
            color: #0ea5e9;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .social-links {
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .social-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 10px;
            color: #64748b;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #e2e8f0;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .security-note {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .security-icon {
            font-size: 20px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .security-note p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #92400e;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .features {
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #0284c7 100%);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .feature-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #475569;
            margin: 0;
            padding-top: 4px;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-container {
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            .email-header, .email-body, .email-footer {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            .email-header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .verify-button {
                padding: 14px 30px;
                font-size: 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon">⚓</div>
                <div class="logo-text">SkillHarbor</div>
            </div>
            <h1>Verify Your Email Address</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <p class="greeting">Hi {{ user.firstName }},</p>
            
            <p class="message">
                Welcome to <strong>SkillHarbor</strong>! We're excited to have you join our community of learners and educators. 
                To get started and unlock full access to your account, please verify your email address.
            </p>

            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" class="verify-button">Verify Email Address</a>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p>
                    <strong>⏱️ This link expires in 24 hours</strong><br>
                    For your security, this verification link will expire on {{ expirationDate|date('F j, Y \\a\\t g:i A') }}.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="features">
                <p class="message" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Once verified, you'll be able to:</strong></p>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📚</div>
                    <p class="feature-text">Access thousands of courses from industry experts</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🎓</div>
                    <p class="feature-text">Earn certificates to showcase your achievements</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
                    <p class="feature-text">Connect with a community of 500,000+ learners</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
                    <p class="feature-text">Participate in discussions and get expert guidance</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="alternative-link">
                <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
                <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}">{{ verificationUrl }}</a>
            </div>

            <div class="security-note">
                <span class="security-icon">🔒</span>
                <div>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Didn't create a SkillHarbor account?</strong><br>
                        If you didn't sign up for SkillHarbor, you can safely ignore this email. 
                        Your email address will not be used without verification.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="message" style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                Best regards,<br>
                <strong>The SkillHarbor Team</strong>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                <strong>SkillHarbor</strong> - Your Harbor for Skills and Knowledge
            </p>
            
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#">About</a> • 
                <a href="#">Help Center</a> • 
                <a href="#">Contact</a>
            </div>

            <p class="footer-text" style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
                © {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} SkillHarbor. All rights reserved.<br>
                This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.
            </p>

            <p class="footer-text" style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 15px;">
                🔐 Your privacy and security are protected with 256-bit encryption
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
